// PERSUADE_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P2472313354" "Please! Don't hurt me!"
// PERSUADE_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P913315743" "Leave me alone!"
// PERSUADE_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P3641853207" "Somebody! Help!"

// PERSUADE_VICTIM_THANKHERO :
"P662071904" "Those guys are madmen!"
// PERSUADE_VICTIM_THANKHERO :
"P3375008300" "You're amazing!"
// PERSUADE_VICTIM_THANKHERO :
"P3741042866" "Is it really you? I've read about you in the paper!"

// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_INACTIVE :
"P467216060" "See what powers await you?"
// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_INACTIVE :
"P2390331947" "The Circle has much to offer."
// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_INACTIVE :
"P1739065970" "Great wisdom and power can be yours."

// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_ACTIVE :
"P1104606757" "You will not stop us!"
// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_ACTIVE :
"P3100377878" "You are a fool to interfere!"
// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_ACTIVE :
"P1572807740" "Leave us!"
// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_ACTIVE :
"P2550339772" "I will rip out your very essence!"
// COT_DEMONSTRATOR_ACTIVE :
"P1193461113" "I will show you true power!"

// PERSUADE_VILLAIN_THREAT1 :
"P4067023475" "Join us, or die in pain!"
// PERSUADE_VILLAIN_THREAT1 :
"P3561524959" "You will give in!"
// PERSUADE_VILLAIN_THREAT1 :
"P434682238" "The Circle will own your soul, or destroy it!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1857660358" "Quiet, my friends.  Just walk."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1454302065" "Shhh...just walk."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1358085734" "I'll know what we need the moment I see it.  For now...walk silently."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1764736391" "Aha!  That is what we need.  Attack!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2735493021" "To arms!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4037510646" "You dare to oppose the Circle of Thorns?  Fool!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2944428984" "Stop...please..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1318875169" "No...stop..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1934874807" "I...stop...please...can't take it..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3550286832" "What...are you...doing...to me?"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P493972717" "You almost stole my soul!  I'm telling!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1245651727" "I'm going to report you for this!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P380178788" "You're going to be in so much trouble!  I'm going to report this right now!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_NPCVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3163005383" "I'm going to the Police Department right now to report you!  You...you...soul sucker!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_SUCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1211249865" "I love Kings Row.  The citizens have such...moxie."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_SUCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P998644120" "Fight all you like...it makes me enjoy this more."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_SUCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P370839211" "This one fights it so desperately.  It cannot win.  But it's so very fun to watch."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_SUCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2039440499" "Ah, I love the strugglers.  Makes it so much more fun."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_SUCKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1807179348" "You dare to interrupt me!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_SUCKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3238532090" "All of Kings Row will see the example of what happens to fools who oppose the Circle of Thorns."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCK_SUCKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1982970903" "I was so close!  Interruption!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P405343570" "Please...just...let me go."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3885186276" "Please, I want to leave!  This roof is so high!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3236353501" "What do you want of me?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2325758021" "What are you going to do with me?  I didn't do anything!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P60800890" "Stop!  Please!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2805803593" "You people are crazy!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P496300023" "I'm reporting this!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2559243038" "You are in so much trouble once I report this!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_ROOFTOPVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3228329756" "You are out of your minds!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_THREATENCROSSBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3278239904" "I STRONGLY recommend that you do not move."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_THREATENCROSSBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3913015602" "Do...not...move."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_THREATENCROSSBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2662482278" "There is a crossbow pointed at your forehead.  I would suggest that you do not move.  This roof is quite high."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_THREATENCROSSBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1867980050" "My finger grows weak, as does my patience.  If I must say it again, there will be dire consequences."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_THREATENCROSSBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P33206340" "Sigh.  Here we go again."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_THREATENCROSSBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4022762649" "Meddling heroes!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_THREATENCROSSBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4265505944" "Hero, you are most unwelcome!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_READSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1920872594" "Hm...interesting."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_READSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2088446337" "This...could be the one.  Let me continue reading a moment."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_READSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P369051318" "This one...this one will do.  The scroll has said it is so."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_READSCROLL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2587367154" "One moment.  I must examine the scroll for guidance."

// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P63471764" "Never forget the teachings."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P835867143" "Do not forget what you have learned."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P2064669330" "The teachings will guide us..."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P218036993" "You dare interrupt me during a lesson?  Insolence!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P973634707" "Cease your prattling.  I will not repeat myself."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P1706504629" "I have taught you all that you know.  I have not taught you all that I know."

// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ATTACK :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ATTACK :
"P608948084" "How dare you interrupt our studies?"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ATTACK :
"P1394742602" "Stop the Heroes!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ATTACK :
"P3169794363" "We will prevail!"

// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P3184932526" "Tell us more..."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P3199072363" "Shhhh. I'm trying to listen!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P2096908910" "Simply fascinating.  I, indeed, have much to learn."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P148690935" "That is interesting.  I have no idea..."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1082152468" "I can't wait to turn one of these 'soldiers' into my own personal pincushion."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2017968880" "At the ready."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2670245343" "My sights are coming in line.  I see opportunity presenting itself."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1399496318" "Soon..."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P890471264" "Now!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1412026879" "Fire!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BEHEMOTH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2893211800" "You...perish...now!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BEHEMOTH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2293609011" "Your...time...is...over!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BEHEMOTH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4218623101" "This is the end for you!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BEHEMOTH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2682028419" "It ends NOW for you!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BONFIRE_CASTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3369234368" "The fire helps me think."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BONFIRE_CASTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2826364178" "Ah, there we go.  Excellent.  Now, let us plan."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BONFIRE_CASTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P450737115" "Our hold is small in this place, but we will make our mark."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BONFIRE_CASTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1301024341" "Again with the interruptions!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_BONFIRE_CASTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1770795999" "Deal with this!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P430267831" "Our destiny is all that is important.  We do not deviate from that."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P971219349" "We will not fail in this.  There is so much more to this 'invasion' than meets the eye."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P386155418" "I see we are not the only ones to take advantage of this Rikti 'situation'."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2148534205" "We must protect our destiny!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3569583464" "Over there!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_THORN_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P247436671" "Will will not be dissuaded!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P181662853" "Follow me.  I could have sworn I heard something."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2665274689" "Another pass.  I am not satisfied."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DAY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2701668354" "Yes.  It's this way.  I will show you."

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_DAY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2375316343" "You have made a grave mistake!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_DAY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4063648916" "And now I will make you pay!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2954339841" "Shhh.  This way."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1609177385" "Quietly, brothers."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2929141425" "Follow me."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2163336061" "There!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1933803763" "I see something!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3613333395" "Let us finish this!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DAY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1302606091" "You have made a terrible mistake!  It will cost you dearly!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DAY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2388378399" "And so it begins!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DAY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2578477983" "Worthless fool!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DAY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1104613503" "Worthless toad!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1894130078" "Let the arrows fly!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2851734369" "You will be my pincushion, hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P90503317" "You will be my target, hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1634991729" "Let loose the arrows!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2635688062" "Take aim!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ARCHERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4030822417" "Let the fight begin!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3946888077" "That's it...keep digging...."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P933903426" "Of course you cannot make yourself stop...it is not my will.  <em>Keep digging."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3390469489" "Don't struggle, just dig."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1627378348" "That's it.  Good.  Dig.  Deeper."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1027400188" "Silence.  Keep digging.  Your complaints make the ire rise in my throat."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P941280095" "I could slay you right here, you whining wretch.  Now dig."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3158023543" "We have had these things digging for a while now.  We should move on.  What we seek is not here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3416552733" "I think this one tires to the point of uselessness.  You may want to take him over soon."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P952330753" "You there!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3042844343" "Wait...I heard something."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2591794311" "I will not stand for this!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3279406778" "Blast!  The spell is broken!  I blame you, hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_SLAVE_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3625171918" "So close!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3077715945" "I saw Legacy Chain wandering about here earlier.  So it seems we have a worthy adversary here in the Hollows."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3224009281" "I do not know why they are here...yet."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3025486096" "The Legacy Chain may have a bent towards the mystical, but they are no match for us."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2236494953" "Legacy Chain?  In the Hollows?  Keep your guard up.  They're on the side of those wretched heroes."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P857447876" "They come for the crystals, but they will not get them."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P598082574" "Feel free to shoot anything that moves, brothers.  It is no matter to me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4262555847" "I've seen them.  Like ants crawling along pavement.  They make their way here, into our lairs. <em> We will stop them."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3098012985" "They play with their lives so carelessly as they make their way to us, thinking they will win."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1928652916" "This ends now!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4292165959" "You will not defeat me this time!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P720156159" "Brothers!  We fight again!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P36931757" "I've most definitely found something here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P634089007" "You appear to be in the wrong place at the right time...for us."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2866283040" "You're not long for this world.  Savor it."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2883620727" "You have no business here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3651038542" "We will not be turned away!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1038168247" "Your cause is lost!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2845094938" "You are on the wrong side!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3655947653" "You are fools and you will pay!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2566413049" "We will not be defeated!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1370056014" "Your pathetic valor has no place here!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LEGACYCHAIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3778077231" "Quiet, miscreant!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LEGACYCHAIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4006952541" "Men!  We fight for honor!  Do not let these robed fools tarnish what we hold dear!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LEGACYCHAIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1407896509" "You are fools!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LEGACYCHAIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P861500654" "You will not win this!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LEGACYCHAIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P163006518" "Do not listen to them, men!  Fight on!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LEGACYCHAIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2676665288" "Your cause is lost, Circle of Thorns!  Admit it now!  Or suffer defeat!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LEGACYCHAIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3659329154" "You cannot win, Circle of Thorns!  Cry off now while you still can!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2225634784" "Hmm...  The crystals and their power...  Interesting."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2690209093" "Ah, yes.  Here it is...the mystical intruder.  I should have seen it before.  Legacy Chain."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2135582483" "Hm...  What's this about midnight?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4201517040" "Ahh...now that makes more sense to me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P522574473" "Hmm..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P845563963" "Is it so now?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2849230937" "I see..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1679065978" "Very interesting..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1923957968" "It was not clear to me before, but now..."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P223724696" "You do not deserve to be here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1462893521" "You will die for your insolence!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2682977403" "You heroes never learn!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2153336889" "The secrets of these pages are for our eyes only!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2902182380" "I don't...feel good..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2862776502" "No...!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2990952454" "Don't...do this!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P980743239" "Oh, no...  My head..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1521762467" "Let me go...please!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2981079424" "I...can't fight this..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2053908036" "Trying...to...fight..."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3093696126" "You're c-crazy!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4005209365" "You can't have my soul!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2329474008" "Thanks, hero!  He tried to suck out my soul!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1195728403" "What kind of maniac is that?!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_SUCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2117728007" "Oh, hush.  It will be mine, you know."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_SUCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1212523136" "Quiet.  Your pathetic cries make no difference to me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_SUCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3869130683" "Shush.  It's not like you were using it."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_SUCKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1724981118" "I was almost through!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_SUCKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P779211315" "Your interruption will cost you dearly!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOULSUCKER_SUCKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2775057379" "No!  Not again!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2797797340" "Mm.  Yes, they're nearby.  I can sense them."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1702516493" "Well, this is an interesting development.  I'm sure the Legacy Chain is utterly unprepared for us."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3833728345" "Shh...brother.  I think I heard something."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2546246093" "The times have changed for us here in the Hollows, I'm afraid.  We'll need to adjust."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4124961746" "Fools.  All of them.  Heroes can't stop us.  Do they honestly think the Legacy Chain can?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P193710645" "How many souls have we...procured...today?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P678295583" "Well, it is what it is.  We will be fine. <em>As always."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1737531613" "Endless opportunity for souls, I would think.  None of these recent...imports...can hurt us."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2220509194" "The Trolls are undesirable.  They have polluted themselves with Superadine.  It makes their bodies...tainted."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4101668183" "I tire of this body.  Soon I will require another."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P32366973" "This body's resources will soon dry up.  The time for another draws near."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3247037994" "Our numbers have thinned for now.  But soon, they will rise again.  You know they always do."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P10441365" "I've seen them...lurking in the shadows.  They do not realize I'm watching."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1522156499" "Yes, your question is a good one.  The heroes should worry.  They are utterly outclassed."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P424822580" "Fools!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1731050340" "You Heroes are pathetic!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3093802492" "I hate you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P591444911" "You are no match for me, Hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2771016861" "I'll drain the soul from your body, Hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3162718985" "The Circle will win!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1843742194" "You can't win this!"

// DARKASTORIA_KOV_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P925400264" "Do not stand in our way!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1004516044" "You threaten something greater than yourself."
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2106579662" "This transgression shall be ignored, if you stand aside."

// DARKASTORIA_GENERIC_ATTACK_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4040563188" "Kill quickly and then flee! We cannot be taken!"
// DARKASTORIA_GENERIC_ATTACK_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1491596211" "Would that he had the time to torture you! A quick death must suffice!"

// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P749137064" "Your crimes will not go unpunished."
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2332698166" "Vindication will be ours!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P374398741" "The evils of your past have now caught up with you!"

// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P596025988" "Kill all you must, but keep some for interrogation."
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3585718340" "We were made for this! We were made to slay the guilty!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2640554229" "Retribution!"


// DARKASTORIA_TOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3491973071" "Darkness has set upon the guilty in this land of retribution!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2125113330" "No lies or evasions can shield the truth from us!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1100552438" "The verdict is guilty, the sentence is death!"

// DARKASTORIA_TOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4198127494" "We are the fate you have been running from your entire wretched existence!"
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1532747068" "That fate brought you to us is all the evidence we need."
// DARKASTORIA_TOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1776824085" "Finally, in this dark place, we have the means to mete out justice to your awful kind!"

// DARKASTORIA_UNASSOCIATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P11855071" "The Hungerer is free! We must escape his grasp!"
// DARKASTORIA_UNASSOCIATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1843545255" "Be on the lookout! We cannot afford to be taken!"
// DARKASTORIA_UNASSOCIATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3562842417" "Unless we escape we are ended!"
// DARKASTORIA_UNASSOCIATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3410282475" "To die here is to be devoured, none will rise again.  Be cautious!"

// DARKASTORIA_COT_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P381854892" "Mot has tasted of your kind and bellows for more!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P86847788" "I am told there is nothing as sweet as that old soul you carry inside you."
// DARKASTORIA_COT_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3076400594" "Your cause is lost, your ancient soul forfeit."

// DARKASTORIA_BP_ATTACK_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2085798117" "Take them all, Mot's hunger will never be fully sated!"
// DARKASTORIA_BP_ATTACK_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2074642430" "All who die herein are doomed! Feed the Master!"
// DARKASTORIA_BP_ATTACK_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2117022875" "Death is the domain of Mot, you must succumb!"

// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2225298992" "No! Nothing more will be ceded to you!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P493610605" "If I must come to an end after all this time, I will leave destruction in my stead!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2548046450" "I have seen eternity and your 'master' does not frighten me!"

// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1135003227" "The Circle bows to no one!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P611367809" "Fools, interlopers, apostates and fiends! I despise you all!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P233038459" "My final breath will not come before your own!"

// KINGS_SUMMON_FAIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1392587596" "I... I wanted only to swell our ranks. But they just... kept... coming."
// KINGS_SUMMON_FAIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P673948408" "What have I done..?"
// KINGS_SUMMON_FAIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2987389255" "Foul things... Once I regain my strength I shall send them ALL back to oblivion."

// KINGS_SUMMON_FAIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4139991741" "Begone, foolish hero! I ALONE shall correct this!"
// KINGS_SUMMON_FAIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3900033824" "I FORBID you to come any closer, hero! This blunder is mine ALONE to correct."

// KINGS_SUMMON_GOOD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2654226470" "Yes! YES! Let the floodgates open! Let her spawn pour into this realm!"
// KINGS_SUMMON_GOOD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2394151757" "Almost there! Soon we will amass an army of these creatures.<em>And THEY shall bring the victims to US!"

// KINGS_SUMMON_GOOD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3218289137" "No! I will NOT allow you to disrupt our divine work!"
// KINGS_SUMMON_GOOD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3674784543" "Loose the hordeling! Let it taste HERO FLESH!"
// KINGS_SUMMON_GOOD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3685979363" "Ah! The hordeling's prey approaches!"

// KINGS_LURE_HORDELING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3316512164" "Obey me, simple creature! Come hither!"
// KINGS_LURE_HORDELING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2220866099" "Just a little closer, you mindless creature."
// KINGS_LURE_HORDELING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2700754688" "That's it, boy... Come to me and I will send you back to hell."

// KINGS_LURE_HORDELING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1965926483" "Ack! Now it's going to get away!"
// KINGS_LURE_HORDELING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1350239292" "Blast, foolish hero! You will PAY for this with your SOUL!"

